---
// Comparison.astro - Tabla comparativa Ventrina vs alternativas
---

<section id="comparativa" class="comparison-section">
  <div class="comparison-container">
    <div class="contrast-header">
      <span class="contrast-tag">Por Qué Ventrina</span>
      <h2>La solución exacta para vender en Venezuela y LatAm</h2>
      <p>No pagues comisiones ocultas ni sufras configurando plataformas que no entienden tus métodos de pago.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Mobile swipe indicator hint -->
    <div class="comp-scroll-hint" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <path d="M18 8L22 12L18 16"></path>
        <path d="M2 12H22"></path>
      </svg>
      <span>Desliza la tabla para comparar alternativas</span>
    </div>

    <div class="comparison-table-wrapper">
      <table class="comparison-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th class="feature-col">Característica</th>
            <th class="highlight-col">
              <div class="comp-col-badge">
                <svg class="comp-badge-sparkle" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="m12 3-1.912 5.813a2 2 0 0 1-1.275 1.275L3 12l5.813 1.912a2 2 0 0 1 1.275 1.275L12 21l1.912-5.813a2 2 0 0 1 1.275-1.275L21 12l-5.813-1.912a2 2 0 0 1-1.275-1.275L12 3Z"></path>
                </svg>
                <span>Recomendado</span>
              </div>
              <span class="comp-col-title">Ventrina</span>
              <span class="comp-col-subtitle">Hecho para Venezuela</span>
            </th>
            <th class="competitor-col">
              <span class="comp-col-title">Shopify / WooCommerce</span>
              <span class="comp-col-subtitle">E-commerce tradicional</span>
            </th>
            <th class="competitor-col">
              <span class="comp-col-title">Vender Manual por Chat</span>
              <span class="comp-col-subtitle">WhatsApp y DMs directos</span>
            </th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td class="feature-cell">
              <strong>Cero % comisiones por venta</strong>
              <span class="feature-desc">El 100% de tus ventas va directo a tu cuenta bancaria.</span>
            </td>
            <td class="highlight-col">
              <span class="comp-check-pill">
                <svg class="pill-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
                <span>✓ 0% comisiones</span>
              </span>
            </td>
            <td>
              <span class="comp-cross-pill">
                <svg class="pill-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line></svg>
                <span>✕ Hasta 2% + pasarelas</span>
              </span>
            </td>
            <td>
              <span class="comp-neutral-pill">
                <span>0% manual</span>
              </span>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td class="feature-cell">
              <strong>Tasa BCV oficial automatizada</strong>
              <span class="feature-desc">Actualización diaria en tiempo real para USD y Bolívares.</span>
            </td>
            <td class="highlight-col">
              <span class="comp-check-pill">
                <svg class="pill-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
                <span>✓ Nativa en tiempo real</span>
              </span>
            </td>
            <td>
              <span class="comp-cross-pill">
                <svg class="pill-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line></svg>
                <span>✕ Requiere plugins de pago</span>
              </span>
            </td>
            <td>
              <span class="comp-cross-pill">
                <svg class="pill-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line></svg>
                <span>✕ Manual con calculadora</span>
              </span>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td class="feature-cell">
              <strong>Pasarelas sin comisiones extranjeras</strong>
              <span class="feature-desc">Pago Móvil, Zelle, Efectivo y transferencias bancarias.</span>
            </td>
            <td class="highlight-col">
              <span class="comp-check-pill">
                <svg class="pill-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
                <span>✓ Nativos sin recargo</span>
              </span>
            </td>
            <td>
              <span class="comp-cross-pill">
                <svg class="pill-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line></svg>
                <span>✕ No soportados en VE</span>
              </span>
            </td>
            <td>
              <span class="comp-neutral-pill">
                <span>Manual por chat</span>
              </span>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td class="feature-cell">
              <strong>Checkout directo a WhatsApp sin intermediarios</strong>
              <span class="feature-desc">El pedido llega limpio con desglose, datos de envío y total.</span>
            </td>
            <td class="highlight-col">
              <span class="comp-check-pill">
                <svg class="pill-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
                <span>✓ Instantáneo en 1 clic</span>
              </span>
            </td>
            <td>
              <span class="comp-cross-pill">
                <svg class="pill-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line></svg>
                <span>✕ Carrito con emails lentos</span>
              </span>
            </td>
            <td>
              <span class="comp-neutral-pill">
                <span>Desordenado en chat</span>
              </span>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td class="feature-cell">
              <strong>Carga de comprobante de pago en el pedido</strong>
              <span class="feature-desc">Captura adjunta directo en el flujo de confirmación.</span>
            </td>
            <td class="highlight-col">
              <span class="comp-check-pill">
                <svg class="pill-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
                <span>✓ Integrada en checkout</span>
              </span>
            </td>
            <td>
              <span class="comp-cross-pill">
                <svg class="pill-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line></svg>
                <span>✕ Requiere apps externas</span>
              </span>
            </td>
            <td>
              <span class="comp-cross-pill">
                <svg class="pill-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line></svg>
                <span>✕ Fotos perdidas en galería</span>
              </span>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td class="feature-cell">
              <strong>Sin tarjeta de crédito extranjera obligatoria</strong>
              <span class="feature-desc">Pagas tu suscripción en Bolívares o Pago Móvil sin trabas.</span>
            </td>
            <td class="highlight-col">
              <span class="comp-check-pill">
                <svg class="pill-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
                <span>✓ Pago Móvil y Bs nativo</span>
              </span>
            </td>
            <td>
              <span class="comp-cross-pill">
                <svg class="pill-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line></svg>
                <span>✕ Obligatoria en USD mensual</span>
              </span>
            </td>
            <td>
              <span class="comp-neutral-pill">
                <span>No aplica</span>
              </span>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td class="feature-cell">
              <strong>Catálogo en bio con variantes (tallas, colores)</strong>
              <span class="feature-desc">Diseñado para redes sociales con carga en menos de 1 segundo.</span>
            </td>
            <td class="highlight-col">
              <span class="comp-check-pill">
                <svg class="pill-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
                <span>✓ Ultra rápido (&lt;1s)</span>
              </span>
            </td>
            <td>
              <span class="comp-neutral-pill">
                <span>Carga pesada en móviles</span>
              </span>
            </td>
            <td>
              <span class="comp-cross-pill">
                <svg class="pill-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line></svg>
                <span>✕ Fotos sueltas por DM</span>
              </span>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td class="feature-cell">
              <strong>Tiempo de configuración y lanzamiento</strong>
              <span class="feature-desc">Sube tus productos y comparte tu catálogo de inmediato.</span>
            </td>
            <td class="highlight-col">
              <span class="comp-check-pill">
                <svg class="pill-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
                <span>✓ Menos de 5 minutos</span>
              </span>
            </td>
            <td>
              <span class="comp-cross-pill">
                <svg class="pill-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line></svg>
                <span>✕ Semanas de configuración</span>
              </span>
            </td>
            <td>
              <span class="comp-neutral-pill">
                <span>Inmediato pero ineficiente</span>
              </span>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
